# Anthropic API Key
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This app calls the Anthropic API directly from the browser.
# The key is injected at build time via Vite's import.meta.env.
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to .env.local  (never commit .env.local)
#   2. Replace the placeholder below with your real Anthropic API key
#   3. For Vercel: add VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# NOTE: The current build passes the key at runtime via the Anthropic
# claude.ai proxy (handled by the platform). If you are self-hosting,
# set this variable and update the fetch call in src/App.jsx to read:
#   headers: { "x-api-key": import.meta.env.VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, ... }
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
